  "description": "A visual metaphor is an image that represents an abstract idea or concept through symbolic imagery. In this meme, the image of multiple hands pointing at the woman serves as a visual metaphor for being targeted, accused, or blamed. Understanding this concept is necessary to interpret the visual symbolism in the image.",
